{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2022-03-01 16:47:00', 'title': "BD NAMES WILLIAM 'BILL' BROWN TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., MARCH 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF WILLIAM "BILL" BROWN TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE FEB. 28, 2022.'}